messages.content:
Add a `side_panel` entry to your manifest and point it at an HTML page:

```json
{
  "side_panel": { "default_path": "src/sidepanel/index.html" }
}
```

Then call `chrome.sidePanel.setPanelBehavior` from the service worker. Docs: https://developer.chrome.com/docs/extensions/reference/api/sidePanel
